May 1913, p198; Yorkshire Weekly Post (Alan Smith collection). Black player:
seems to be Frank J Macdonald of Egremont (Wallasey), Cheshire (The Chess
Amateur - Volume 7 - Page 260). Possibly Frank John Macdonald, bank clerk,
born c1882 in Birkenhead but living with his father in Southport in 1911 
(Census) - note rec'd from Gerard Killoran, 10 January 2021} 1-0

